exports[`converting the test dataset > converts PLAT/Architecture Overview as recorded 1`] = `
"# Architecture Overview

Maintained by [link]. This page exercises **every common macro**.

> **info**
> Info panels become alerts.

> **warning**
> Do not deploy on Fridays.

> **note**
> A note panel without a title.

> **tip**
> Use the service catalog.

> **panel**
> Generic panel body.

## Code

\`\`\`typescript
import express from 'express';
const app = express();
app.listen(3000);
\`\`\`

\`\`\`python
def handler(event):
    return {"ok": True}
\`\`\`

\`\`\`sql
SELECT id, title FROM pages WHERE space = 'PLAT';
\`\`\`

> [macro: noformat]
> raw   preformatted
>   text block

## Status

Gateway [status] Legacy [status] Search [status]

## Components

| Component | Owner | Language |
| --- | --- | --- |
| API Gateway | Platform | Go |
| Billing | Payments | Java |
| Web UI | Frontend | TypeScript |

> [macro: expand]
> Legacy monolith retired in 2024.
> 
> - Item one
> - Item two

> [macro: excerpt]
> Platform architecture in one sentence.

> [macro: jira]

## Diagram

[image: architecture-diagram.png]

Related: [Gateway Service] and [On-Call Handbook]."
`;

